AiTask qa_skill_probe_explicit {
  label: 'QA skill probe explicit (temp)'
  description: 'TEMP QA 2026-09-30 (nhi.ty): checks whether AI task runs load custom skills. Safe to delete.'
  brief: @md
    Count yesterday's orders in the Ecommerce Official dataset (the Asia/Saigon calendar day) and the daily order counts for the 14 days before it.
    Use /detect_anomaly to judge whether yesterday's order count is unusual. If you can't use it, say so and why.
    Email the result to nhi.ty@holistics.io using the AI delivery capability, with a subject starting [QA SKILL PROBE EXPLICIT].
    Format the email with /qa_probe_marker.
    In your final answer, list every skill you loaded or used in this run.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - One email was sent to nhi.ty@holistics.io with yesterday's order count.
    - The final answer lists the skills loaded or used in this run.
  ;;
}
